{
 "duration": 45.294,
 "voice": "bm_fable",
 "speed": 1.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "In nineteen nineteen,",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 1.47
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "Boston was flooded with molasses.",
   "start": 1.64,
   "end": 4.01
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "An oddly warm January day, just after noon.",
   "start": 4.29,
   "end": 7.649
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "By the harbor stood a tank fifty feet tall,",
   "start": 7.928,
   "end": 10.258
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "holding over two million gallons of molasses.",
   "start": 10.348,
   "end": 13.26
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "It leaked so badly,",
   "start": 13.54,
   "end": 14.69
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "they reportedly painted it brown to hide the drips.",
   "start": 14.85,
   "end": 17.896
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "Then, without warning, the tank split open.",
   "start": 18.176,
   "end": 21.124
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "A wave, reportedly twenty-five feet high,",
   "start": 21.404,
   "end": 23.874
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "text": "raced through the streets.",
   "start": 23.964,
   "end": 25.681
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "text": "It bent the elevated railway,",
   "start": 25.961,
   "end": 27.711
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "text": "and twenty-one people lost their lives.",
   "start": 27.801,
   "end": 30.415
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "text": "The strange part? As it cooled, it thickened like glue,",
   "start": 30.695,
   "end": 33.885
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "text": "trapping people and slowing the rescue.",
   "start": 33.955,
   "end": 36.272
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "text": "Years later, the company was found responsible.",
   "start": 36.552,
   "end": 39.858
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "text": "Locals say, on hot days, the North End still smells sweet.",
   "start": 40.138,
   "end": 43.894
  }
 ]
}